---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Ornament from '../components/Ornament.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About | Syamsul Arifin">
  <article class="essay">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <div class="essay-body">
      <p>
        I'm a full-stack engineer based in Indonesia with five plus
        years building production web and mobile applications across
        consumer platforms, marketplaces, e-commerce, and EdTech. I
        work in React, Next.js, TypeScript, Node.js, Laravel, REST
        APIs, and MySQL, and I try to own delivery from idea through
        to production.
      </p>

      <p>
        The kind of problems I find most satisfying are the
        boring-sounding ones. Why is the bundle this large. Why is the
        query this slow. Why did SSR quietly stop working. The wins
        don't fit on a screenshot, but the user feels them: a 50%
        cut in cloud infrastructure costs, a 30% lift in SEO scores,
        a blank first page restored.
      </p>

      <p>
        Long before I wrote code, I was a <em>penceramah</em>, an
        Indonesian word for a public speaker, often religious, who
        stands in front of an audience and explains. As a child I did
        this often. It taught me that an idea you can't say out loud is
        an idea you don't really understand yet. I'm still trying to
        live up to that.
      </p>

      <p>
        This site is my attempt to write more: about software, about
        books, about thinking carefully when the world rewards the
        opposite. If you end up here and want to talk, my email is the
        best way.
      </p>
    </div>

    <Ornament />

    <p class="contact meta">
      Reach me: <a href="mailto:arifsaqa@gmail.com">arifsaqa@gmail.com</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .contact { text-align: center; }
</style>
